\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces KITTI heading error vs distance on 05/07/10. The network heading wanders by 2--7$^\circ $; the gyroscope integrated over the true image intervals stays within about $\pm 0.5^\circ $. The step on 05 near 1.13\,km lies in a 1.62\,s OXTS outage and appears in both, so it most likely comes from the ground truth.}}{6}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:heading}{{6}{6}{KITTI heading error vs distance on 05/07/10. The network heading wanders by 2--7$^\circ $; the gyroscope integrated over the true image intervals stays within about $\pm 0.5^\circ $. The step on 05 near 1.13\,km lies in a 1.62\,s OXTS outage and appears in both, so it most likely comes from the ground truth}{figure.6}{}}
